java.question:
Each `Card` has a `rank` (for example `"9"` or `"K"`). After the loop processes the third card, what is in `counts`, and does the method return then?

```java
List<Card> cards = List.of(
    new Card("9", "Hearts"),
    new Card("9", "Diamonds"),
    new Card("9", "Hearts"),
    new Card("K", "Clubs")
);
Map<String, Integer> counts = new HashMap<>();
for (Card card : cards) {
    if (!counts.containsKey(card.rank)) {
        counts.put(card.rank, 1);
    } else {
        counts.put(card.rank, counts.get(card.rank) + 1);
    }
    if (counts.get(card.rank) == 3) {
        return true;
    }
}
return false;
```

